  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The gold Punch-Out!! Special (HVC-PT-S), box, and manual were given away as a prize for the Nintendo Famicom Golf US competition. Nintendo released this version of Punch-Out!! prior to any other version. That may be why it has some differences, including wording, color, and music variations. There also isn't a final “dream bout” with Mr. Dream or Mike Tyson; the game ends after you defeat Super Macho Man.\r\n\r\nYou play as Little Mac, a young boxer fighting his way up through ranks of the World Video Boxing Association. After facing a series of colorful fictional opponents in three circuits and winning the championship in each, Little Mac enters a final &quot;Dream Fight&quot; against a highly skilled boxer."
    }
  ],
